# Build context for the images in docker/.
#
# Allowlist, not deny-list. Without this file the context is 667 MB — .git alone
# is 304 MB, docs/node_modules 98 MB, and bin/ ships a stale 98 MB binary — all
# of it transferred to the daemon on every build and none of it needed to compile
# ghost-ship or cargoship-test.
#
# If a new Dockerfile needs another path, add it here. The docker-build CI lane
# will fail loudly rather than silently building against a truncated tree.
*

# Go module definition — the first COPY in every Dockerfile
!go.mod
!go.sum

# Source. cmd, internal, and pkg are the complete dependency closure of both
# binaries (`go list -deps ./cmd/ghost-ship ./cmd/cargoship-test`).
!cmd/
!internal/
!pkg/

# Config templates copied into the runtime image
!configs/

# Never needed at build time, and re-excluded here so a future `!pkg/**` style
# widening cannot pull them in.
**/*_test.go
**/testdata/
